            "question": "<strong>How much can this diaper bag hold?&nbsp;</strong>",
            "content": "<p>This diaper bag has a spacious 25L capacity, providing ample room for all of your baby's essentials, along with mom and dad’s daily necessities. It’s designed to keep everything organized and easily accessible.</p>",
